    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47228</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_050_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>『なりきり士』の力って
不思議だけど、すごいね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Your "Roleplayer" powers are
pretty strange, but amazing, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47340</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_050_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>初めはわたしも戸惑いました。
いつもと全然違う自分になって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It confused me, too, at first. It was like I
was suddenly someone completely different.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47436</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_050_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、それがだんだん
気持ちよくなってきて</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But over time, I
started to really like it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47596</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_050_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;の恍惚の表情は、何度見てもたまらんだー∀
それも含めて『なりきり士』の、すんばらしいところだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And seein' &lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt; all euphoric's wonderful for me,
too~ ∀ It's one of the amazin' things about "Roleplayers."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47704</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_050_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>私も思いきって、
いつもと違う自分に変身したいです……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'd like to be able to change into a
completely different person, too...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47828</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_050_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それじゃあ、甘栗を食べるといいよ、
ヘンシン（天津）だけに……なんて……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, then, can't you just ask a shopkeeper to break a
large bill for you? If all you want is some "change"... Haha...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>47964</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_050_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……くだらねぇだ、ひらひらマント野郎。
そしだら、ミーたまも着替えてみるだか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...That was awful, ya cape-flappin' weirdo. But
would ya like to try on some clothes, Miss Minty?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48040</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_050_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>やめろ、このエロダンス！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't you dare, you
friggin' pervy closet!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48144</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_050_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>む、無理じゃないかな？
ほら、サイズが合わないしさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>S-She probably couldn't wear them, anyway, could
she? I mean, they're completely different sizes...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48260</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_050_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……そう、ですよね……
&lt;Mint&gt;さんの胸のサイズじゃ私の衣装は……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...That's...true... Mint's breasts
would never fit in my clothes...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>48364</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_050_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あの……普通に体のサイズの話かと
思うのですが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Umm... Well, I think he was just making a
normal comment on the size of our bodies...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
